		<item>
			<title>Update: Super Bowl for Italian Fans on Sportitalia 2</title>
			<link>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/550-update-super-bowl-for-italian-fans-on-sportitalia-2.html</link>
			<guid>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/550-update-super-bowl-for-italian-fans-on-sportitalia-2.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>As we already reported, <strong>Italian Madonna's fans</strong> can watch the <strong>Super Bowl</strong> live on <strong>Sportitalia</strong>. But the latest news is that the big event will be broadcast by <strong>Sportitalia 2</strong> (digitale terrestre - channel 61).</p>
<p> </p>
<p>We remind you that you can also watch the <strong>Super Bowl</strong> live on <strong>ESPN America</strong> (satellite - in chiaro, pacchetto SKY).</p>
<p> </p>
<p>The live coverage start at midnight (Italian local time).</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>TV</category>
			<pubDate>Sat, 04 Feb 2012 15:12:02 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
